ay exhibit different preferences when it comes to vehicle engine power vs. driving age. This interaction could capture indirect behavioral patterns.\ndf[\'driver_age_by_engine_capacity\'] = df[\'Age_of_Driver\'] / df[\'Engine_Capacity_(CC)\']\n```end\n\n### Step 2: Group statistics based on Vehicle_Type and calculate average Age_of_Driver\n```python\n# average_driver_age_by_vehicle_type\n# Grouping drivers by Vehicle_Type and calculating the average Age_of_Driver for each group.\n# Usefulness: Certain vehicle types (e.g., sports cars vs. family cars) may be more common for specific genders and age groups. Including such aggregated statistics can aid prediction.\ndf[\'average_driver_age_by_vehicle_type\'] = df.groupby(\'Vehicle_Type\')[\'Age_of_Driver\'].transform(\'mean\')\n```end\n\n### Step 3: Encode Urban_or_Rural_Area and combine with Propulsion_Code via concatenation\n```python\n# urban_rural_by_propulsion_code\n# Concatenating Urban_or_Rural_Area and Propulsion_Code as a categorical feature.\n# Usefulness: Urban or rural areas combined with the propulsion type could reveal driving environment preferences linked to gender (e.g., electric vehicles vs. fossil-fuel vehicles in urban areas).\ndf[\'urban_rural_by_propulsion_code\'] = df[\'Urban_or_Rural_Area\'].astype(str) + \'_\' + df[\'Propulsion_Code\'].astype(str)\n```end\n\n### Column Dropping: Remove redundant or low-variance features\n```python\n# Explanation why the column Was_Vehicle_Left_Hand_Drive? is dropped\n# This column exhibits extremely low variance (Mean = 1.0018, Std = 0.0426) indicating that almost all vehicles are left-hand drive. It is unlikely to provide additional predictive power.\ndf.drop(columns=[\'Was_Vehicle_Left_Hand_Drive?\'], inplace=True)\n```end\n\n```python\n# Explanation why the column 2nd_Road_Number is dropped\n# Most values (Median = 0, Q3 = 0) indicate this feature is often missing or irrelevant for the majority of samples. It likely contributes minimal information to the model.\ndf.drop(columns=[\'2nd_Road_Number\'], inplace=True)\n```end\n\nThese steps strike a balance between intuitive real-world patterns, statistical insights, and feature relevance, aiming to improve the predictive power of a potential model.']
